<title>UK: UK meals/feeds trade remains in the doldrums.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds trade remains in the doldrums.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the UK meals and feeds market remained very slow on Wednesday with the few buyers being pushed to the sidelines by steadier prices.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal sellers were around one stg higher following gains in Chicago on Tuesday on talk of Chinese interest.</p>
<p>Only one trade was reported when corn gluten feed pellets fetched 98 stg a for spot material on the resale market ex-store Avonmouth.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
